  "executive_briefing": "In late August 2026, the digital asset ecosystem is navigating a crucial phase of structural maturation. The upcoming Senate vote on the CLARITY Act (H.R. 3633) scheduled for September 15th dominates regulatory discussions, representing a key milestone for institutional capital allocation. Concurrently, institutional spot Bitcoin ETFs have completed their initial speculative phase, transitioning into standard multi-asset portfolio allocations despite recent stabilization trends. Within execution layers, Ethereum's dominant EVM network effects face targeted competition from non-Turing-complete alternatives like Clarity on Bitcoin, designed to resolve EVM's inherent security vulnerabilities. In parallel, cross-chain DeFi is moving away from centralized, exploit-prone wrapped token bridges towards native, non-custodial BTC-to-ETH liquidity swap protocols.",
